-      "excerpt": "Let $a : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{R}$ be a sequence of reals and $n \\in \\mathbb{N}$,\nwith finite sums as in [[def-finite-sum]] and the absolute value as in\n[[def-abs-value]]. Then\n\n$$\\Big|\\sum_{k<n} a_k\\Big| \\le \\sum_{k<n} |a_k|.$$",
